        "created_at": "2020-10-03T16:23:56.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>So I was going to say \"I'm surprised the hero themes are done so quickly, it was only a short while ago only half of them were finished enough to show off\", but then I checked and that was in February which was actually more like eight months ago.</p>\n<p>Man, this year has been hell on one's time sense, lol.</p>",
